  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure a substantial 12,600m² development site in the highly sought-after coastal suburb of Red Beach.\r\n\r\nWith Resource Consent already approved for nine generous residential lots, this property offers developers and investors an exciting opportunity to create a premium residential development in an established, desirable neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nThe vendor is highly motivated and genuinely committed to selling. Serious buyers are encouraged to act!\r\n\r\nKey Highlights\r\n1.26ha (12,600m²) substantial landholding\r\n\r\nRC approved for 9 residential lots\r\n\r\nGenerous section sizes from 860m² to 2,280m²\r\n\r\nResidential Large Lot Zone\r\n\r\nTown water and wastewater services available at the street\r\n\r\nPositioned in a peaceful cul-de-sac surrounded by quality homes, the property offers a beautiful natural setting with easy access to Red Beach, Silverdale, Orewa, shopping centres and motorway connections. The ongoing Penlink project further enhances the area's future connectivity.\r\n\r\nIdeal for developers seeking their next project or investors looking for a substantial coastal landholding with long-term potential.\r\n\r\nThe vendor wants this SOLD! Don't miss this rare opportunity.\r\n\r\nContact me today for further information, RC documentation or to arrange a site inspection.",
